# Bari Vara backend context

Before scaffolding or editing code in this repository:

1. Read and follow [`skills.md`](../../skills.md) at the backend root.
2. For agent skill entry, use `.cursor/skills/bari-vara/`.
3. Mirror existing files under `src/` — do not invent new layouts.
4. Zod/types live in `src/shared` (`#shared`). API modules use routes → controller → service → serializer. Keep schema contracts aligned with the frontend repo.
